  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nKIDS CLUB\n\nOnce a month on Wednesdays after school and on Friday mornings in the holidays, activity sessions for girls and boys aged 6-9 years.\n\nNo Parents! Packed with trails, quizzes, games, craft, active learning, kitchen science and outdoor fun.\n\nA new theme each session including topics inspired by the Museum, the seasons and the best of the school curriculum.\n\nBooking essential! See What's On for details and click through to book. For more information, contact the Education Officer on 01993 810211 or email education@sofo.org.uk\n\nWhat people are saying:\n\n\"[My kids] had a great time, thank you! I also spoke to lots of the other mums and they said all their kids loved it too! such a great service!\"\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
  "footerText": ""
